   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Modelling both as named enums with enforced transitions - not a free-text status or a pair\nof booleans - is what makes 'A FINISHED GAME NEVER RE-SCORES' and 'A MATCHED TICKET IS\nNEVER RE-MATCHED' checkable at the type level rather than by review.",
   "originalText": "Modelling both as named enums with enforced transitions - not a free-text status or a pair\nof booleans - is what makes 'A FINISHED GAME NEVER RE-SCORES' and 'A MATCHED TICKET IS\nNEVER RE-MATCHED' checkable at the type level rather than by review.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
