   "locked": false,
   "text": "a stale client routing entry, or a reconnect that raced the Session Router. Rejected outright, with the client redirected via\nsessionRouter.locate(game_id) - rather than the instance guessing at intent.",
   "originalText": "a stale client routing entry, or a reconnect that raced the Session Router. Rejected outright, with the client redirected via\nsessionRouter.locate(game_id) - rather than the instance guessing at intent.",
