   "text": "NOT an immediate forfeit. GameSession starts a bounded abandonment timer (60 s, longer for a slower time control), and\nreconnection inside that window resumes from board_state exactly as it stood - with no special-cased 'recovering a dropped\ngame' logic beyond the normal reconnection path.",
   "originalText": "NOT an immediate forfeit. GameSession starts a bounded abandonment timer (60 s, longer for a slower time control), and\nreconnection inside that window resumes from board_state exactly as it stood - with no special-cased 'recovering a dropped\ngame' logic beyond the normal reconnection path.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
