   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Repository          MatchmakingPool and MoveLogWriter hide storage behind method calls; neither MatchFormationService nor\n                    GameSession issues a raw query or cache command directly\nStrategy            ChessEngine (standard rules versus a variant) and RatingService (Elo versus another system), both\n                    swappable behind one interface with no caller knowing which is active\nState, via an enum  GameStatus and MatchmakingTicket's enforced one-way transitions - the same discipline as PaymentStatus\n                    and DeliveryStatus elsewhere in this guide\nACTOR-PER-GAME      worth naming explicitly, because it is the one pattern here that differs from this guide's\n                    stateless-request-handler default: GameSession is a SINGLE-WRITER, SINGLE-INSTANCE owner of one game's\n                    state for that game's entire life - which is exactly what makes the concurrency reasoning above hold.",
   "originalText": "Repository          MatchmakingPool and MoveLogWriter hide storage behind method calls; neither MatchFormationService nor\n                    GameSession issues a raw query or cache command directly\nStrategy            ChessEngine (standard rules versus a variant) and RatingService (Elo versus another system), both\n                    swappable behind one interface with no caller knowing which is active\nState, via an enum  GameStatus and MatchmakingTicket's enforced one-way transitions - the same discipline as PaymentStatus\n                    and DeliveryStatus elsewhere in this guide\nACTOR-PER-GAME      worth naming explicitly, because it is the one pattern here that differs from this guide's\n                    stateless-request-handler default: GameSession is a SINGLE-WRITER, SINGLE-INSTANCE owner of one game's\n                    state for that game's entire life - which is exactly what makes the concurrency reasoning above hold.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
